@startuml
title H52 - Recepción de Avisos Call Center
skinparam maxMessageSize 250

box "Frontend (sgrai-web)" #White
actor "Call Center" as user
participant "BandejaAvisosUI" as view
participant "Hook Sockets\n(useCallCenterSocket)" as hook
end box

box "Backend (sgrai-api)" #LightGoldenRodYellow
participant "SocketGateway" as socket
end box

box "Eventos Externos"
participant "Ciudadano / Portal" as trigger
end box

== 1. Emisión Origen ==
trigger -> socket: POST /api/incidentes/avisos (Nuevo reporte)
socket -> socket: broadcast.to('callcenter').emit('nuevo_aviso', DTO)

== 2. Recepción en Cliente (Tiempo Real) ==
socket --> hook ++: Evento 'nuevo_aviso' recibido por Socket.io-client
hook -> hook: store.unshift(nuevoAviso)
hook -> view: Dispara re-render

== 3. Feedback Activo ==
view -> user: Muestra "badge" de nuevo mensaje o nueva fila en tope de tabla
view -> user: Play sonido de notificación suave (Opcional)
@enduml
